WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.890
Stampa himself came out in
one of his mobile suits,

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.480
and in doing so,
caused a tragedy.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.980
Mondo, don't lose control.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.110
When the enemy in front
of you steals your attention,

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.570
you'll get killed by the next one.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:52.160
Even though we might be
playing right into Haman's hands,

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:55.830
we approached an
area close to Core 3.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:02.090
THE GIRL FROM CORE 3

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:02.090
(Part 1)

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.530
This is Cicero?
It's small for a mine.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:25.940
They're going to
connect this to Core 3?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:29.110
We're here because we got
a report that they were planning to.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:31.070
If we don't infiltrate
this mining asteroid...

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:34.620
before it docks, it's going
to be a lot harder for us.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.620
Now's the time when
they'll be most relaxed!

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.500
H-Hold on a sec!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.500
C'mon, let's go.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.900
First, we need to hide the
dummy asteroids we came here in.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.050
Beecha and Iino are taking
care of that. Don't worry.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.600
It's Beecha and Iino.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.230
Looks like everything
went okay.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.610
Okay, let's go!

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.510
Lady Haman.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:36.390
We've recalled Chara Soon
to suppress the Lamoon rebels...

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.520
with Nee and Lance
to keep an eye on her.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:43.440
Chara's mental state
is still far from perfect,

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.150
but it won't be long until
we're docked with Cicero.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.190
It should serve as
suitable training for her.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:53.240
Also, a ship commanded by
Glemy Toto has departed Core 3...

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.700
to bring down the
Nahel Argama.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.460
Rakan Dahkaran.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.590
Haman is troubled by
the rebellion within Side 3...

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:11.210
as well as the Nahel
Argama's movements.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:15.720
No doubt about it.
This is Judau I'm sensing.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.220
It's coming so strongly
from around Cicero.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.930
I know you can now
remotely operate the Qubeley,

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.810
but don't overdo it, Ple-Two.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:28.150
Spare me your concern!
I'll capture him for my revenge!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.780
With Ple-Two
in this state,

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:38.530
the time is near when
I can take Axis for myself.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.790
Wait and see, Judau.
This time, I'll finish you!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.800
Looks like it's mealtime.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.130
Go!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.570
Judau, are you okay?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:13.490
That looked like a
blast for mining, but...

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.070
I can't believe they set
it off without a warning!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.380
There's air!

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.590
- The ones from before.
- These are brand new!

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.390
We'd better hurry up with this!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.390
We'll be fine once
we take over Cicero.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:43.820
How do we do that?

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:47.810
There are many among the
miners who are opposing Neo Zeon.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.810
We have plenty!

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.690
Here, take another.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:54.320
- Can I have some more?
- Hang on.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.400
There you go.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.060
Thanks!

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.700
Here!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.200
You work hard, little girl!
We appreciate it!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.720
This is hardly
what I'd call work.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:08.250
Hurry up and eat, or else
Cat-Eyed Chara will get on your case!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.380
Look what's inside.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.000
Is that enough?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.880
Of course not.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:16.590
Want mine?

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:20.540
I don't want more of the same.
It's not my wife's cooking.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.100
Sorry, I'm from somewhere else.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.100
It's Haman's fault!
And Chara's!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.310
We had it better when
the Zabis were in charge!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.650
Hey! If Chara hears that,
you'll get the whip!

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.900
I don't care!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:37.610
You've had enough of this, too!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.610
I'm telling you to be quiet!

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:40.820
Screw Haman!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:41.780
Stop it!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:44.370
Maybe you should stop that.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.700
Stay out of this, kid!

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.710
- I'll knock your cowardly head off!
- What?!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.830
Look, there's a way
you can just go home.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:53.960
You...

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.210
Team 5, get to work!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:59.090
I told you. Team 13
got 15 minutes for lunch!

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.590
That voice!

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.970
Cat-Eyed Chara!

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:04.300
What are you doing?!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:08.350
You're handing them
out too slow!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.270
Finish eating, already!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.820
Chara! Since when do
you yell at kids like that?!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.320
You're...

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.490
Is that you, Judau?

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.780
Judau, it's been forever!
How are you?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.990
Lemme go! Chara!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:30.000
Have you gotten
a little more mature?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.790
I'm so happy!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.130
- Chara!
- Oh, that feels so good!

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.250
Hey!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.040
- Act your age, you old hag!
- Get lost!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.220
I haven't had so
much fun in ages!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.840
Mistress Chara!

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:46.100
Chara, someone's calling you!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:48.390
You look so happy,
Judau!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.520
Uh-oh!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:52.390
Seeing a young man
has changed her back?

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:55.400
I love young guys!
They're so smooth!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.610
Now look!

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.190
- Mistress Chara!
- What?

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:01.360
You have to direct the
docking of Cicero to Core 3!

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:04.200
I haven't seen my favorite type in
a while! Would you shut up?!

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:06.620
You are Chara Soon of Neo Zeon!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.750
l know that!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.290
And a Qubeley has slipped inside.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.750
What? No one told
me about that!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.500
We shouldn't let the
resistance elements know.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.000
Who opened the airlock?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.340
It opened spontaneously.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.590
That's impossible!

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:24.760
Not for the Qubeley's pilot.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.800
Right!

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.100
Judau!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.140
Sorry, Elle.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.480
We're holding it up at airlock 1.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.690
Right!

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.030
The Qubeley? Chara!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.150
Yes?

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.320
The Qubeley!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:43.070
Damn that Glemy!
What's he up to?! Let's go!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.610
What the hell...?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:50.120
Let's talk to these guys
before they come back.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:53.410
What are you talking about!
I'll bet you're spies for Cat-Eyed Chara!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.460
What happened
to all that spirit from before?

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.880
You've got us wrong!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.960
You think Chara would be hugging
just anyone like that?!

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.710
She's just like that!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:03.800
Now, look.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.510
Hey, time for work!

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:09.300
Come on! Forget those kids.

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:12.390
It's all Boobzilla's fault!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:14.350
We'll just have to
do this ourselves.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.390
Just us six?

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.610
I can deal with it just fine.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:21.020
Here you go.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.240
You're not from
around here, are you?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.700
Eat.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.910
They have 12-year-olds
doing forced labor?

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.870
Well, it's because my
father disappeared when...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:37.210
the Axis soldiers came.
He never came home.

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:39.040
So I was conscripted in his place!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.960
Still, you seem pretty cheerful.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:44.300
Being cheerful is
all I have to offer!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.510
No point in moping around.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.800
I think we can use those kids.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:52.350
Yeah. They made Chara
act really strange.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.810
Why are you here?

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:58.020
That's my line, Ple-Two!

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:01.730
Silence! I came because
this place worries me.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.440
Because you're being careless!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.030
What?!

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.400
Cicero is giving off
an unpleasant aura.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:14.290
- S-Stop! Don't do that here!
- Don't lose your heads!

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:17.410
Stay there, till I return.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.880
I can deploy those
funnels any time I like!

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.250
Hey! Wait!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:27.340
Take Chara hostage?
There's no way we could!

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.380
Not that way.
I'll reason with her.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:32.220
Chara doesn't like fighting us.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.340
If we offer good terms,
she might get on board.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.310
Like have her do our laundry again?

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.390
Don't make fun of it.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.150
C-Can we help you?

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.490
What's this all about?!

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:52.200
Um, if you're going to
eat us, we taste terrible!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.910
Enough with the
bad joke, guys!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.120
Grab 'em!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.370
We're not your enemies!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.870
Don't touch me!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.210
Perverts!

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.050
Mr. Judau!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.250
- Sit down!
- All right, jeez!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.840
What are you
going to do to us?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.130
Why, you...!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.310
Get up! I said get up!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.130
Okay! Okay!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:21.120
We won't hurt you. We're just
gonna use you a little.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.560
Mr. Judau and the others...!

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.940
Get them inside.
We don't have much time!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.460
I'm opening the trunk.
Stand back.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.700
Father! What's he doing here?!

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.910
- Hurry!
- Go on.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.580
All right!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.960
Father!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.760
All set, Roy!

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.420
Father, wait!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.340
Father!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.010
What?

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:59.140
Please, give me a lift!
My father's in that truck. Please!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.020
- Get on.
- Thank you!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.710
What do you want with us?!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:31.970
When we get out of here,
we'll see you all in court!

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:34.010
Treating people like garbage!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.510
Think Chara will go for this?

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:36.720
She will.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:40.140
The way she was hugging
the boy, he must be special!

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:44.060
We're with the AEUG!
We're friends of the space colonists!

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:46.270
AEUG? Oh...

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:49.230
No one told us about that.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:54.610
It's true! We're from
the Nahel Argama.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.990
Nahel Argama?!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:01.240
What do you think, Mr. Roy?

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.250
Chara.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.750
We'll figure that out
after we take Chara hostage.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.290
This is as far as I can go.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:11.340
Thank you.
You're a really good person!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.130
A good person?

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:18.010
- Someone's coming.
- What?!

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:19.890
Whoever's coming, help us!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.010
We're here!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.430
Shut up!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.110
Father?

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.240
Father!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.930
Father, where are you?

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.870
Don't shoot!
Rutina!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.910
Father!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.540
Rutina, why did you come here?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.500
What about you?!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.090
You're just a child.
Why...?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.510
She was conscripted in your place!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:57.880
Because you abandoned your own
kid for the anti-war movement!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.300
I can't believe Neo Zeon would
conscript children, too!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:05.310
Neo Zeon was after your father.

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:09.520
If he went home, you'd get mixed up
in that, too! He had to hide!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.770
But you left me alone!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:15.490
But if we're together...

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.070
You don't get it.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:18.610
Children want their
parents to be with them!

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.740
Mr. Judau!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.200
Why are you doing this to them?!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.500
Mr. Judau and the others
aren't bad people!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:27.290
Exactly!

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:29.420
Yeah! We're not bad people!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.420
Stop that!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.420
Stop!

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.210
- Stop it.
- But...

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:37.880
Rutina's got good intuition.
Let's hear them out.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.350
Roux.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.390
Like you said, we're just kids.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:48.950
So we thought it would be easier
to infiltrate Core 3 through Cicero.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:53.900
If your objective is to bring down Haman,
shouldn't we be working together?

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.610
I doubt we can
take Chara hostage.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.240
I can try and get
her on our side!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.360
I need the Qubeley.

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:07.370
What's...?!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.920
No good!

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.710
Hurry!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.800
Try and convince Cat-Eyed Chara.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:20.380
I'm pretty sure I know
how to handle her.

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:21.380
Hurry!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:21.930
Sure!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:25.890
Do your best, seeing how
we're still hostages here!

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:29.180
Rutina!
Hang on till I get back!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.400
See you!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:35.770
Just approach them slowly.
Slower!

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.360
Pin the funnels down while
they aren't flying everywhere!

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:45.620
As if I'd let you
touch my Qubeley!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.790
They're moving again!

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:57.500
Close the next airlock!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.760
Don't let it escape!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:04.590
The Qubeley?
Ple-Two's here?!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:07.430
- It's Chara!
- Now's our chance!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.690
Mistress Chara!

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.530
I said don't let it escape!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:20.900
- A revolt!
- What?!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.900
A revolt!

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.320
A rebellion's broken out!

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:25.990
At a time like this!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.620
You two deal with the revolt!

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.410
Right!

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.370
- Let's go!
- Right!

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.120
Chara!

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.580
Who are you?!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.460
l came to talk
to you, Chara.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.500
What?!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.500
It's me, Judau.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.550
Why not end the war
and relax by doing laundry?

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:45.470
Laundry?!
Don't mock me!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:49.010
You liked it, Chara!
What's wrong with you?

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:52.390
Address me with respect!
A mere laborer...!

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:56.360
Chara! You... They've got
you under mental control!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:17:00.980
Okay? We've planted explosives
at the end of this unused tunnel.

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.820
Once we detonate them,
you can get outside.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:07.240
Outside? You mean
we can just leave?

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:11.450
If you call the Nahel Argama,
we can all escape.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.910
Get out while we
buy you some time.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.210
Gotcha.

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.920
Get down!

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.010
- Go on.
- Right!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.600
The air's leaking!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.600
They're planning to
attack from outside!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.310
Get back to the
Gaz-L and Gaz-R!

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:36.390
Right!

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.100
You sure about this, Rutina?

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.860
If you're not bad people,
you shouldn't be tied up!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:45.690
- Who did this?!
- Don't come out!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.320
Where's Judau?

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.700
The girl from before!

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:52.410
Rutina!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.960
Where? If you don't
tell me, I'll shoot!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.000
- Don't!
- Rutina!

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.460
Why are you doing this?

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.420
Out of the way!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.130
These are good people!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.800
Move, or I'll shoot you, too!

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:08.720
You wouldn't, because you're
not a bad person, either!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:13.760
I have to pay Judau back!
Stand aside!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.210
- Rutina, hit the floor!
- It's dangerous!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:21.400
I'll send you to the most
dangerous work site!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.980
Don't you remember doing
laundry for us on the Argama?

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.400
No!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:28.990
Or Moon Moon?!
Remember Miss Rasara?!

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:31.810
Miss Rasara died.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.950
Rasara's dead?

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.580
What are you talking about?

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.330
Chara...

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:41.670
Mistress Chara!

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.590
Chara?

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:48.220
Oh, what's this sensation?
It feels so good!

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.220
Mistress Chara!

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:53.640
What...?
What's wrong with me?

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:58.390
Who are you?! Why do you
affect Mistress Chara so strangely?!

00:18:58.390 --> 00:18:59.980
Are you a Cyber-Newtype, too?!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.230
Beecha?!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.200
He's escaping!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.280
I'm getting pulled out!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.410
Mistress Chara! Hang on tight!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.620
Launch the Geymalk!

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.660
We'll escort you, Mistress Chara!

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.000
Judau's out!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.000
You can see him?

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.250
I know Judau.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.100
Judau!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.480
Iino! Mondo! Dock to
form the Double Zeta!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:40.140
Roger!

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:57.620
The Double Zeta's docked?
Take it from here, Judau!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:58.580
Roger!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.540
Reinforcements?

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:07.000
You won't stop me!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:07.840
Chara!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:09.300
You again?!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.890
Stop it, Chara!

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:16.050
Shut up!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.310
Why don't you remember?
Please, remember!

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:24.690
Would you stop it?!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.900
Remember me!

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.400
Remember your life
on the Argama!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:32.570
Stop it! Stop it!
I feel giddy in my head!

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.170
So careless in a place like this!

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.130
Damn you! Damn you!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.720
- Calm down!
- Mistress Chara, keep cool!

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.090
We'll head back to Cicero.

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:59.220
Its docking with Core 3
is nearly complete.

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:03.060
Once it's complete, our fighting
strength will be doubled!

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:05.310
Yes... yes, that's right.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:09.730
I lost my mind.
What's wrong with me?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.240
Next time we meet,
that boy will die!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:27.080
It looks like I can't
reason with Chara.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.290
She's changed.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.800
Is there still a
way in to Cicero?

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.710
That hole should
still be there.

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.840
We can get back in easily!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.800
Are you kidding me?!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:39.300
It's true.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:43.560
Your friends and Rutina were taken
by some strange mobile suit...!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:48.140
The Qubeley!
They were taken by Ple-Two!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.810
Rutina...

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:53.150
It's my fault. All my fault...

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:54.400
We'll take them back!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:57.280
Right! Let's get into
Core 3 right now!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.110
No!

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:00.530
Have you forgotten
what happened to Miss Rasara?!

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:01.490
You idiot!

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:04.500
If we go now, we'll be playing
right into Haman's hands!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:07.790
What would Miss Rasara think
if we died pointlessly?!

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:10.080
We can't screw this up!

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.800
So we're doing
this the right way.

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:15.090
Sorry, Judau.

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:19.090
I want to rescue Elle
and the others, too!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:49.960
As we infiltrate
Haman's new colony,

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:54.020
Ple-Two plots to assassinate
Haman under orders from Glemy!

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:55.960
Naturally, Haman makes
her own move, as well!

00:23:55.960 --> 00:24:01.180
But her move comes too late
because I've become a barrier to her.

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:04.720
Thanks to that,
asteroid Cicero is set free.

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:08.890
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Girl From Core 3."

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.890
Next Time

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.890
THE GIRL FROM CORE 3

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.890
(Part 2)

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:10.980
I'm powerful!
